     "<div dir=\"ltr\">All,<div><br></div><div>This is a reminder of <a href=\"https://r-nimble.org/nimble-virtual-short-course-january-4-6-2023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://r-nimble.org/nimble-virtual-short-course-january-4-6-2023&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476566372000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1icRgDXV0obmXQ6V8OG2ta\">our virtual short course</a>, to be held the first week of January. There are still spots available.</div><div><br></div><div>We recently added support for automatic differentiation to NIMBLE in a <a href=\"https://r-nimble.org/beta-version-of-nimble-with-automatic-differentiation-including-hmc-sampling-and-laplace-approximation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://r-nimble.org/beta-version-of-nimble-with-automatic-differentiation-including-hmc-sampling-and-laplace-approximation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476566372000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DvY3tmC6BBwU9YhaMDzxx\">beta release</a>, and the workshop will cover these new AD capabilities (and our new Hamiltonian Monte Carlo sampler and Laplace approximation) in detail. </div><div><br></div><div>You can register <a href=\"https://forms.gle/8NuUcDJtMUGxCHv78\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://forms.gle/8NuUcDJtMUGxCHv78&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476566372000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1IdFxi9aRHCurJSU8X7HOH\">here</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>-Chris </div></div>\r\n"
    ]
